# Second Brain — Local Cloudflare Worker development variables
# Copy this file to `.dev.vars` for `npm run dev` (Wrangler loads `.dev.vars` automatically).
# Never commit `.dev.vars` — it is listed in `.gitignore`.
# For production deployments, set secrets via `npx wrangler secret put AUTH_TOKEN`.

# REQUIRED: Bearer token / OAuth login password protecting all REST API, dashboard, and MCP routes.
# Generate a strong secret with: openssl rand -base64 32
AUTH_TOKEN=replace-with-a-strong-secret-token

# OPTIONAL: Grace window (milliseconds) before newly captured entries without vectors
# are flagged as unvectorized or retried by POST /vectorize-pending.
# Defaults to "300000" (5 minutes) in wrangler.jsonc.
# VECTORIZE_GRACE_MS=300000

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Cloudflare Bindings (configured in wrangler.jsonc, NOT in .dev.vars):
#   DB         - D1 SQLite database (`second-brain-db`)
#   VECTORIZE  - Vectorize index (`second-brain-vectors`, 384 dims, cosine)
#   AI         - Workers AI binding (embeddings + LLM classification/synthesis)
#   OAUTH_KV   - Workers KV namespace (OAuth client registrations/tokens + Notion integration state)
#   ASSETS     - Static dashboard files in `./public`
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
